@ Sabrina and the player are childhood friends who are now dating.
@ Conversations use existing story flags and do not require previous visits.

Sabrina_Text_PalletIntro::
    .string "You used to race me here.\n"
    .string "Now you hold my hand.\p"
    .string "Go see PROF. OAK.\n"
    .string "I can wait a little longer.\p"
    .string "LEAF has her own journey.\n"
    .string "It's time you began yours.$"

Sabrina_Text_PalletPartner::
    .string "You chose a POKéMON.\n"
    .string "Let me have a look.\p"
    .string "I'll try not to fuss.\n"
    .string "But please take care of it.\p"
    .string "And yourself.\n"
    .string "For me.$"

Sabrina_Text_PalletFirstBadge::
    .string "The BOULDERBADGE suits you.\n"
    .string "Go on. Let me see it.\p"
    .string "You used to bring me stones\n"
    .string "you thought were treasures.\p"
    .string "This one's worth keeping.\n"
    .string "You earned it.$"

Sabrina_Text_PalletMarshBadge::
    .string "Back where we started.\n"
    .string "It feels smaller now.\p"
    .string "You beat me at my own GYM.\n"
    .string "I'll never forget that.\p"
    .string "But here, we can just be us.\n"
    .string "Stay a little while.$"

Sabrina_Text_PalletEightBadges::
    .string "Eight BADGES.\n"
    .string "Let me look at them again.\p"
    .string "We used to race to ROUTE 1.\n"
    .string "Now you can face the LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "I won't look ahead.\n"
    .string "Come tell me yourself.$"

Sabrina_Text_PalletChampion::
    .string "CHAMPION…\n"
    .string "I like how that sounds.\p"
    .string "But you can still hold\n"
    .string "my hand on the way home.\p"
    .string "Some things are worth\n"
    .string "keeping the same.$"

Sabrina_Text_ViridianBeforeGym::
    .string "There's a GYM here, too.\n"
    .string "Don't let it hurry you.\p"
    .string "I liked our childhood races.\n"
    .string "This journey isn't one.\p"
    .string "Your POKéMON need a partner,\n"
    .string "not someone chasing a clock.$"

Sabrina_Text_ViridianAfterGym::
    .string "GIOVANNI was the LEADER…\n"
    .string "I wish I had known sooner.\p"
    .string "You faced him anyway.\n"
    .string "I'm proud of you.\p"
    .string "I won't predict the LEAGUE.\n"
    .string "I want you to surprise me.$"

Sabrina_Text_PewterBeforeGym::
    .string "BROCK looks stern, but he\n"
    .string "cares for his POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Watch how he battles.\n"
    .string "Strength can be patient.\p"
    .string "And don't make that face.\n"
    .string "I'm cheering for you.$"

Sabrina_Text_PewterAfterGym::
    .string "So you beat BROCK.\n"
    .string "You've earned that smile.\p"
    .string "Let your POKéMON rest.\n"
    .string "A victory is work for them.\p"
    .string "We could visit the MUSEUM.\n"
    .string "That counts as a date.$"

Sabrina_Text_CeruleanBeforeGym::
    .string "MISTY won't hold back.\n"
    .string "I wouldn't ask her to.\p"
    .string "You always did enjoy\n"
    .string "a little competition.\p"
    .string "Save that smile for after\n"
    .string "the battle, all right?$"

Sabrina_Text_CeruleanAfterGym::
    .string "The CASCADEBADGE, too?\n"
    .string "MISTY is a fierce opponent.\p"
    .string "I remember you splashing me\n"
    .string "when we were children.\p"
    .string "This is a much better use\n"
    .string "of WATER-type POKéMON.$"

Sabrina_Text_CeruleanBill::
    .string "BILL gave you a ticket?\n"
    .string "You must have helped him.\p"
    .string "You always stop for people,\n"
    .string "even when you're in a hurry.\p"
    .string "That's one reason I said yes\n"
    .string "when you asked me out.$"

Sabrina_Text_VermilionBeforeCut::
    .string "The S.S. ANNE is impressive.\n"
    .string "All those people traveling…\p"
    .string "A voyage sounds lovely.\n"
    .string "We should take one someday.\p"
    .string "For now, enjoy the harbor.\n"
    .string "You don't have to rush.$"

Sabrina_Text_VermilionBeforeGym::
    .string "You helped the CAPTAIN?\n"
    .string "Kindness travels well.\p"
    .string "LT. SURGE favors raw power.\n"
    .string "Think before you move.\p"
    .string "GROUND types may help.\n"
    .string "Consider that a small hint.$"

Sabrina_Text_VermilionAfterGym::
    .string "The THUNDERBADGE, too?\n"
    .string "You're looking pleased.\p"
    .string "I know that expression.\n"
    .string "You wore it at hide-and-seek.\p"
    .string "I promised not to peek then.\n"
    .string "I kept that promise.$"

Sabrina_Text_LavenderBeforeRescue::
    .string "This town feels heavy.\n"
    .string "Even I need quiet here.\p"
    .string "MR. FUJI cares for POKéMON\n"
    .string "others have left behind.\p"
    .string "If you find someone hurting,\n"
    .string "listen before you speak.$"

Sabrina_Text_LavenderAfterRescue::
    .string "MR. FUJI is safe.\n"
    .string "The town feels lighter.\p"
    .string "I won't ask you to explain\n"
    .string "everything you saw up there.\p"
    .string "We can stand here a while.\n"
    .string "You don't have to say a word.$"

Sabrina_Text_CeladonBeforeGym::
    .string "ERIKA makes her GYM peaceful.\n"
    .string "Don't mistake that for ease.\p"
    .string "Even a gentle person can\n"
    .string "be a difficult opponent.\p"
    .string "You learned that about me\n"
    .string "rather early, didn't you?$"

Sabrina_Text_CeladonAfterGym::
    .string "The RAINBOWBADGE is lovely.\n"
    .string "ERIKA has excellent taste.\p"
    .string "I nearly asked her for\n"
    .string "two cups of tea.\p"
    .string "Finish exploring.\n"
    .string "We can share a cup later.$"

Sabrina_Text_CeladonRockets::
    .string "TEAM ROCKET was hiding\n"
    .string "beneath the GAME CORNER…\p"
    .string "You went down there knowing\n"
    .string "someone might need help.\p"
    .string "I love that about you.\n"
    .string "I still wish you'd be careful.$"

Sabrina_Text_CeladonAfterGymRockets::
    .string "ERIKA's BADGE suits you.\n"
    .string "So does that relieved smile.\p"
    .string "TEAM ROCKET is gone, too.\n"
    .string "CELADON feels like itself.\p"
    .string "We could share some tea.\n"
    .string "You've earned a quiet moment.$"

Sabrina_Text_FuchsiaBeforeGym::
    .string "KOGA makes patience a weapon.\n"
    .string "POISON wears a team down.\p"
    .string "Bring ANTIDOTES.\n"
    .string "Rest when you need to.\p"
    .string "Yes, I worry about you.\n"
    .string "That comes with dating me.$"

Sabrina_Text_FuchsiaAfterGym::
    .string "KOGA couldn't catch you out?\n"
    .string "You've become observant.\p"
    .string "Perhaps I should stop hiding\n"
    .string "your gifts behind my back.\p"
    .string "…No. That would spoil\n"
    .string "the fun.$"

Sabrina_Text_SaffronRockets::
    .string "I'm helping families here.\n"
    .string "TEAM ROCKET has them afraid.\p"
    .string "There is so much anger.\n"
    .string "I need to keep my mind clear.\p"
    .string "Please watch yourself.\n"
    .string "Come back safely.$"

Sabrina_Text_SaffronFreed::
    .string "SAFFRON can breathe again.\n"
    .string "You helped give us that.\p"
    .string "I had so much to say.\n"
    .string "For now, I'm glad you're safe.\p"
    .string "I'll be waiting at my GYM.\n"
    .string "No hints when we battle.$"

Sabrina_Text_SaffronAfterGym::
    .string "That was some battle.\n"
    .string "I say that as your GYM LEADER.\p"
    .string "You made me proud.\n"
    .string "I say that as myself.\p"
    .string "Now let me put work aside.\n"
    .string "Let's walk together awhile.$"

Sabrina_Text_CinnabarBeforeGym::
    .string "BLAINE loves his questions.\n"
    .string "Take a moment to think.\p"
    .string "You used to guess first\n"
    .string "and explain yourself later.\p"
    .string "Please tell me that's not\n"
    .string "your battle strategy.$"

Sabrina_Text_CinnabarAfterGym::
    .string "You passed BLAINE's test.\n"
    .string "And his battle, apparently.\p"
    .string "I can almost hear you asking\n"
    .string "if I doubted you.\p"
    .string "I didn't.\n"
    .string "I wanted to hear you say it.$"

Sabrina_Text_LeagueBeforeChallenge::
    .string "I won't look ahead.\n"
    .string "This belongs to you.\p"
    .string "Remember to trust the team\n"
    .string "that brought you here.\p"
    .string "Whatever happens in there,\n"
    .string "come tell me yourself.$"

Sabrina_Text_LeagueChampion::
    .string "CHAMPION…\n"
    .string "I like how that sounds.\p"
    .string "I had a speech prepared.\n"
    .string "It's gone completely now.\p"
    .string "Come here.\n"
    .string "Let me be happy with you.$"

Sabrina_Text_OneIslandBeforeRescue::
    .string "BILL and CELIO are busy.\n"
    .string "Even on an island like this.\p"
    .string "Do your errands.\n"
    .string "I'll enjoy the sea breeze.\p"
    .string "Then find a moment for us.\n"
    .string "That's all I ask.$"

Sabrina_Text_OneIslandAfterRescue::
    .string "LOSTELLE is home safely.\n"
    .string "Now you can finally rest.\p"
    .string "No GYM. No predictions.\n"
    .string "Just the sea and us.\p"
    .string "Stay a little while.\n"
    .string "We have time.$"

Sabrina_Text_OneIslandPostgame::
    .string "Even a CHAMPION deserves\n"
    .string "a moment by the sea.\p"
    .string "Whatever brings you here,\n"
    .string "take time for yourself, too.\p"
    .string "We can make a quiet memory.\n"
    .string "Just the two of us.$"

Sabrina_Text_GymAfterBlaine::
    .string "BLAINE awarded you a BADGE?\n"
    .string "Those quizzes are merciless.\p"
    .string "You look ready for more.\n"
    .string "Remember to rest sometimes.\p"
    .string "I'm allowed to fuss a little.\n"
    .string "That's part of dating me.$"

Sabrina_Text_GymAfterGiovanni::
    .string "So it was GIOVANNI.\n"
    .string "Even my visions have limits.\p"
    .string "You earned the EARTHBADGE.\n"
    .string "Now the LEAGUE awaits.\p"
    .string "I won't tell you the future.\n"
    .string "I want to hear your story.$"

Sabrina_Text_GymChampion::
    .string "My favorite person became\n"
    .string "the CHAMPION of KANTO.\p"
    .string "I keep saying it to myself.\n"
    .string "It still makes me smile.\p"
    .string "You can visit without\n"
    .string "challenging the GYM, you know.$"

